+# at 34-90 (2 of 24 alive at 150; 6 of 40 on seeds 1-20, 7 of 40 on fresh 21-40). L 40 and 60 only delay
+# it (2, 5 of 24). Off: 15 of 24, 27 of 40, fresh 26 of 40. Lone H150 42.1 m, D150 0.246 (10 seeds).
+# The trunk spurs come back mainly on suppressed stand trees; the dominant boles stay near clean.
 # The irregularity base's departure (overnight 2026-11-06, agent S, on beech's own descriptors; ADR
 # 0055): less shoot-length variation, a wider spread of branch angles. Passed G-forest on the garden.
 "c1.shootLengthSD" = 0.35
